Package: hifiberry-auth
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-flask, python3-waitress, python3-argon2, adduser
Description: HiFiBerry OS authentication/authorization gateway
 A small localhost service that enforces authentication for the HiFiBerry OS
 web APIs. It classifies each endpoint (ok vs risky) from per-package drop-in
 manifests and answers nginx's auth_request: normal music use stays password
 free, while risky operations require a device password.
